"Let me die."

514
00:34:36.080 --> 00:34:38.949
There are no masters
in the grave. Your Grace.

515
00:34:40.118 --> 00:34:41.618
Is it true what
Master Kraznys told me

516
00:34:41.653 --> 00:34:44.788
