<i>♪ Three boys. a goat.
and a dancing bear ♪</i>

797
00:51:40.451 --> 00:51:44.221
<i>♪ They danced and spun
right to the fair ♪</i>

798
00:51:44.255 --> 00:51:47.791
<i>♪ How sweet she was.
so pure and fair ♪</i>

799
00:51:47.825 --> 00:51:51.528
<i>♪ The maid with honey
up in her hair ♪</i>

800
00:51:51.562 --> 00:51:55.065
<i>♪ He smelled her all
in the summer air ♪</i>

801
